  "title": "Pasta Carcione",
  "description": "This easy pasta dish is very colorful and features the creamy tart flavor of goat cheese. Juicy red tomatoes and thin strips of garden-fresh spinach are tossed with hot farfalle and olive oil. Crumble goat cheese over the top and serve warm.",
